@startuml
title Model — данные сетки, геометрии и групп
top to bottom direction
scale max 1500 width
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam nodesep 16
skinparam ranksep 20
hide empty members

interface IModelData
interface IObjectsData
interface IGroupData
interface IGroup
interface "IObjectsSet<T>" as IObjectsSet
interface "IObjectsCollection<T>" as IObjectsCollection
class ModelData {
  + Append(modelData)
  + Load(path)
  + Save(path)
}
class ObjectsData
class GroupData
class VolumeData
class "ObjectsSet<T>" as ObjectsSet
class "ObjectsCollection<T>" as ObjectsCollection
class Group

IModelData <|.. ModelData
IObjectsData <|.. ObjectsData
IGroupData <|.. GroupData
IGroup <|.. Group
IObjectsSet <|.. ObjectsSet
IObjectsCollection <|.. ObjectsCollection
ModelData *-- ObjectsData
ModelData *-- GroupData
ModelData *-- VolumeData
ObjectsData *-- ObjectsSet
ObjectsData *-- ObjectsCollection
ObjectsCollection *-- ObjectsSet
GroupData o-- IGroup

note right of ObjectsData
  Иерархии геометрических и сеточных объектов:
  Model-1.mdpuml
end note
note right of ModelData
  Загрузка, сохранение и прогресс чтения:
  Model-2.mdpuml
end note
@enduml
